grh_full_proof
AI-generated bilingual reconstruction of the proposed Dirichlet GRH proof

Upstream research and formalization
----------------------------------
The upstream README credits the underlying proof to Levent Alpöge working
with Claude. Alpöge's announcement is available at https://alpo.ge/remark.pdf.
The shorter Lean 4 formalization was produced by Luke Sernau and colleagues
at Anthropic with Claude. It builds on Mathlib.

Pinned Lean source
https://github.com/lsernau/grh-lean/tree/72fead102f663d5c7a407964a13dc0cf9d977207

Reconstruction
--------------
ChatGPT generated the English and Simplified Chinese manuscripts dated
26 November 2026. The PDFs recast the argument in natural language and
mathematical notation, adding expository text, intermediate arguments, and
bibliographic references. They are research drafts for study and review.
The machine checks reported by the upstream project apply to its Lean code.
The upstream sources above should be cited for the underlying proof.

